  "No order (general chat)": "不绑定订单（通用对话）",
  "Select an order to inject line items and totals into Chatbot or Plan-Execute-Replan.": "选择订单后，Chatbot 或计划-执行-重规划模式将注入行项目与金额。",
  "How to use AI": "查看 AI 使用说明",
  "Got it": "知道了",
  "AI import content": "AI 导入内容",
  "1. Enter a topic or brief (any language) on the left.\n2. Click Generate Chinese Draft for a zh-first article.\n3. Review and edit the draft on the right.\n4. Select text and press Ctrl+K (Mac: ⌘K) for inline AI edits.\n5. Click Confirm & Publish to translate all locales and publish to the public blog.": "1. 左侧输入主题或要点（中英文均可）。\n2. 点击「生成中文草稿」，AI 先输出中文正文。\n3. 审阅右侧草稿，可手动修改。\n4. 选中文字后按 Ctrl+K（Mac：⌘K）可局部 AI 修订。\n5. 满意后点击「确认并发布」，系统自动翻译全部语言并发布到前台博客。",
  "Ctrl+K inline edit": "Ctrl+K 局部修订",
  "1. Select text in title, excerpt, or body.\n2. Press Ctrl+K (Mac: ⌘K) to open the floating editor.\n3. Describe the change (e.g. add compliance details, shorten title).\n4. Preview before/after diff — Accept or Reject.\n5. Repeat until satisfied, then publish.": "1. 在标题、摘要或正文中选中一段文字。\n2. 按 Ctrl+K（Mac：⌘K）打开浮动修订框。\n3. 描述要如何修改（如：补充法规细节、缩短标题）。\n4. 预览修改前/后 Diff，点击「接受」或「拒绝」。\n5. 可多次修订，直到满意再发布。",
  "Modal AI generate": "编辑弹窗 AI 生成",
  "While editing content, enter a topic and click Generate with AI to fill title, body, etc. (Chinese draft, no auto-translate).\nUse AI Translate in the translations section for other locales after saving.": "在编辑/新建内容时，输入主题后点击「AI 生成」，将根据主题填充标题、正文等字段（默认中文草稿，不自动翻译）。\n保存前可在表单中修改；已有文章可用「AI 翻译」补全多语言。",
  "AI translate content": "AI 一键翻译",
  "When editing saved content, click AI Translate under Translations.\nSource fields (usually Chinese) are translated to en/ko/ar/ja/th/vi/id/ms.\nReview each locale tab and save.": "编辑已保存的内容时，在「多语言翻译」区域点击「AI 翻译」。\n系统会以主字段（中文）为源，自动翻译到 en/ko/ar/ja/th/vi/id/ms 等语言。\n翻译完成后请检查各语言 Tab 并保存。",
  "AI import product": "AI 导入产品",
  "1. Describe the product in natural language (specs, ingredients, packaging, certs).\n2. Choose input language and click Generate with AI.\n3. Review auto-filled fields on the right.\n4. Click Save Product.\nUse AI Translate for other locales after saving.": "1. 用自然语言描述产品（规格、成分、包装、认证等）。\n2. 选择输入语言，点击「AI 生成」。\n3. 右侧预览自动填充的字段，检查并微调。\n4. 点击「保存产品」写入目录。\n生成后可用「AI 一键翻译」补全多语言。",
  "Product AI translate": "产品 AI 翻译",
  "When editing a product, click AI Translate under Translations.\nName, summary, description, ingredients, etc. are translated from the primary locale.\nReview locale tabs before saving.": "编辑产品时，在「多语言翻译」区域点击「AI 翻译」。\n将以主语言字段为源，批量翻译名称、摘要、描述、成分等文本到其它语言。\n请保存前核对各语言 Tab。",
  "AI console": "AI 应用控制台",
  "Pick an Agent mode on the right, then chat:\n• Chatbot: Q&A; optional order context.\n• Plan-Execute-Replan / B2B Coordinator / Trade Assistant: streaming agents.\n• Recommend / Search / Translate / Analyze inquiry / Generate quotation: one-shot JSON.\nFor Chatbot, select an order in the sidebar to discuss that order.": "右侧选择 Agent 模式后输入问题：\n• 聊天机器人：通用问答；可选绑定订单注入上下文。\n• 计划-执行-重规划 / B2B 协调器 / 贸易助手：流式 Agent 对话。\n• 产品推荐 / AI 搜索 / 翻译 / 分析询价 / 生成报价：单次 JSON 结果。\nChatbot 模式下可在侧边栏选择订单以讨论具体订单内容。",
  "XLSX AI translate": "XLSX AI 翻译",
  "Upload Excel, choose single or batch translate mode.\nAI translates headers or selected column keys — useful for reports and term sheets.\nDownload the result; try a small sample before batch jobs.": "上传 Excel 后选择「单语翻译」或「批量翻译」。\nAI 会翻译表头或指定列的文本 key，适合报表、术语表批量本地化。\n翻译完成后下载新文件；建议先小样本试译再批量处理。",
  "Trade AI assistant": "贸易 AI 助手",
  "Chat about this trade — documents, compliance, logistics.\nAgent may call trade tools; replies stream in the chat panel.\nUse AI Generate Document below for PI/CI/SC drafts.": "在本交易详情页与 AI 对话，可询问单据、合规、物流等问题。\nAI 可调用贸易工具；流式回复显示在聊天区。\n需要生成 PI/CI 等文档时，使用下方「AI 生成文档」按钮。",
  "AI generate trade document": "AI 生成贸易文档",
  "Pick document type (PI, CI, SC, etc.) and optional context.\nAI drafts from current trade data and saves to the system.\nAlways verify fields in the document list before sending to customers.": "选择文档类型（PI、CI、SC 等），可补充上下文说明。\nAI 基于当前交易数据生成文档草稿并写入系统。\n生成后请在文档列表中核对字段，必要时人工修正。",
  "Generates a quotation draft from inquiry products and requirements.\nDraft is advisory only — enter official amount and validity in the form below before submitting.": "根据询盘产品与需求，AI 生成报价草稿（金额说明、条款建议等）。\n草稿仅供参考，请核对后在下方表单填写正式报价金额与有效期并提交。",
  "AI compliance summary": "AI 合规分析",
  "AI summary of inquiry compliance/risk flags when configured.\nFor sales reference only — not a substitute for legal/compliance review.": "系统对询盘内容进行 AI 合规/风险摘要（若已配置）。\n结果供销售参考，不能替代法务或合规团队最终判断。",
  "Import AI column mapping": "导入 AI 列映射",
  "After uploading an inventory/product Excel file, AI suggests column → field mappings.\nReview the blue banner and adjust mappings below before confirming import.": "上传库存/产品 Excel 后，系统会用 AI 建议「Excel 列名 → 系统字段」映射。\n蓝色提示区显示 AI 建议，可在下方映射表中调整后再确认导入。",
